#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectstereoenhance.rst:16 9c8be5e67d25466abbf6f27ac6585238
msgid "Stereo enhancement effect for widening or narrowing the stereo field."
msgstr "立体声增强效果。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectstereoenhance.rst:21 0ff3dde4c4ef423ab9597a7e993389d0
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectstereoenhance.rst:23 88449d49e43143eebfeb3968bdb8884e
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance is a stereo widening/enhancement effect that can expand or contract "
"the perceived stereo width of audio signals. It uses multiple techniques including pan pullout, "
"time-based separation, and surround processing to manipulate the stereo image."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance**    用于加宽或强化立体声形象。   ``pan_pullout``    调整左右声像拉开感，   "
"``time_pullout_ms``    增加双声道时间差，   ``surround``    控制环绕增强量。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectstereoenhance.rst:25 5143c31ef92143d39e951b343f573ff0
msgid ""
"The effect can create wider, more immersive stereo fields for music and sound effects, or narrow "
"the stereo image for mono compatibility. Use it to add spaciousness to narrow recordings, create "
"special stereo effects, or ensure mono compatibility when needed."
msgstr "可扩展音乐和音效的立体声声场，也可缩窄声像以改善单声道兼容性。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectstereoenhance.rst:27 1d6d8d43a10c443ea9f7df71c3b52086
msgid ""
"The pan pullout spreads low frequencies to the sides while keeping mid frequencies centered, time"
" pullout introduces micro-delays between channels for width, and surround adds depth to the "
"stereo field."
msgstr "声像扩展将低频向两侧展开并保持中频居中；时间扩展通过声道间的微小延迟增加宽度；环绕参数增加声场深度。"

