#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectstereoenhance.rst:87 043803d2ffce4aa08048dce3988540d6
msgid ""
"The amount of pan-based stereo widening applied. Range: 0.0 to 4.0. Default: 1.0. Higher values "
"spread the stereo image wider by moving different frequency components to different positions in "
"the stereo field. This creates a sense of width while maintaining center image stability. A value"
" of 0.0 disables this effect."
msgstr "声像拉开量"

