msgid ""
"The amount of surround processing applied to the stereo field. Range: -100.0 to 100.0. Default: "
"0.0. Positive values enhance the ambient/spatial components of the signal, creating a more "
"enveloping sound. Negative values can make the stereo image more focused and direct. This "
"parameter manipulates the difference (L-R) signal to alter spaciousness."
msgstr "环绕增强量"

